    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"> R語言在暈到死Windows NT系統算是次等公民, R語言在該系統出的問題比較少被關注, 安裝也比較複雜<br>若是閣下有被強迫升級到 windows 10, 那就可以受惠微軟少見的德政, Win 10 底下有個 Linux 相容層, 可以跑大多數Linux的程序, 可以裝Linux版本的R<br><br>參考 <a href=\"https://blog.birkhoff.me/bash_on_windows_installation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://blog.birkhoff.me/bash_on_windows_installation/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237922611000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3piaqmU2l48nx27BMeeT4-\">https://blog.birkhoff.me/bash_on_windows_installation/</a><br><br>要跑Rstudio之類的圖形界面應用程式, 要裝這個 <a href=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/xming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sourceforge.net/projects/xming/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237922611000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01LzyqM1a2bCTgb-1nA_ao\">https://sourceforge.net/projects/xming/</a><br>並參考 <a href=\"http://www.howtogeek.com/261575/how-to-run-graphical-linux-desktop-applications-from-windows-10s-bash-shell/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.howtogeek.com/261575/how-to-run-graphical-linux-desktop-applications-from-windows-10s-bash-shell/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237922611000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QLDHOR01e-oWrGKtk6pw4\">http://www.howtogeek.com/261575/how-to-run-graphical-linux-desktop-applications-from-windows-10s-bash-shell/</a><br>找不到中文版, 但跳過前言, 從Step one跑到Step four也不需要讀英文, 看圖跟命令說故事就好<br><br><br>干皓丞於 2016年8月28日星期日 UTC+8上午8時06分34秒寫道：</div>"
